<title>DENMARK: SAS says May traffic up 4.8 percent Y/Y.</title>
<headline>SAS says May traffic up 4.8 percent Y/Y.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian Airlines System (SAS) said on Monday that its passenger traffic rose by 4.8 percent in May 1997, compared to May 1996.</p>
</text>
